   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Simple past and present perfect",
   "texto": [
    "Use the simple past with a finished time: **Jeg studerte i fjor** («I studied last year.»). Use **har + participio** for an undated experience or a situation that follows: **Jeg har studert her i to år** («I've been studying here for two years.»)."
   ]
